  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ul><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Hơn nữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, vẽ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, vẽ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tương tự, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>J</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>J</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\tDo đó các đoạn giao tuyến của mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> với các mặt của hình lăng trụ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tạo thành tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (do cùng song song với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.)<br>Vậy tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình thang.</li></ul></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f46a657e377a5a610664e4f92303f55c15f456c8489b0b4824ed7cfdf484fa9b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
